{"id":"re_ponse","lemma":"réponse","pos":"noun","rank":594,"glosses":["response, answer, reply (a communication)","response, reaction (biological or organic process effected by an foreign agent)","retort, comeback"],"ipa":"/ʁe.pɔ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/29/Fr-r%C3%A9ponse.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A9ponse.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"réponses"},"formAudio":{"réponses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-r%C3%A9ponses.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La réponse est simple.","en":"The answer is simple.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102786","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"simple"}]},{"text":"Je veux juste des réponses.","en":"I just want some answers.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Peux-tu expliquer ta réponse ?","en":"Can you explain your answer?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to explain"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Tu connais la réponse ?","en":"Do you know the answer?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je déteste ce genre de réponses.","en":"I hate those kinds of answers.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"kind"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}